// Decide evaluates a bounded set of reachable positions and immediate actions.
// It does not mutate state or consume random numbers. Only known contacts feed
// exposure/search; a hidden actor's new location never generates a candidate.
func (s CombatState) Decide(space CombatSpace, r CombatRules) CombatDecision {
